d 'HSCC': module to provide Heterogeneous-Slope SCC (HSCC) estimator for panel data
d
d    HSCC provides a data-driven joint partial-pooling framework
d between conventional pooled/SCC estimation and fully
d heterogeneous Mean Group approaches. The method jointly models
d systematic and residual slope heterogeneity and applies an
d adaptive penalty to residual slope deviations. For inference, it
d uses an HC3-adjusted Driscoll–Kraay/SCC covariance estimator.
d The current version also allows common time fixed effects through
d the timefe option. 
d
d KW: panel data
d KW: heterogeneous slope
d KW: partial pooling
d
d Requires: Stata version 17
d
d Distribution-Date: 20260928
d
d Author:  Zehra Yalnız,  Kocaeli University
d Support: email zehrayalnizz41@@gmail.com
d
f hscc.ado
f hscc.sthlp
f hscc_example.do
